sequenceDiagram
    participant Operator as TrustyAI Operator
    participant Job as lmes-job Pod<br/>(LMEvalAdapter)
    participant EvalHub as EvalHub Service<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Model as Model Endpoint<br/>HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>HTTPS

    Note over Operator,Job: Flow 1: Standard Evaluation Job

    Operator->>Job: Create Kubernetes Job<br/>(LMEvalJob CRD)
    Job->>Job: Read /meta/job.json<br/>(path traversal guard)
    Job->>EvalHub: POST status: initializing<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    Job->>HF: GET datasets, tokenizers<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN (optional)
    HF-->>Job: Dataset artifacts

    loop For each evaluation batch
        Job->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>Auth: OPENAI_API_KEY
        Model-->>Job: Model completions
    end

    Job->>Job: Score and aggregate results<br/>(sanitize errors)
    Job->>EvalHub: POST status: completed<br/>Auth: Bearer token
    Job->>OCI: Push results artifact<br/>(via skopeo)<br/>Auth: Registry credentials
    Job->>MLflow: Log metrics<br/>Auth: Configurable
    Job->>EvalHub: POST final results<br/>Auth: Bearer token

    Note over Operator,Job: Flow 2: Disconnected / Air-Gapped

    Operator->>Job: Create Kubernetes Job<br/>(with /test_data mount)
    Job->>Job: Read /meta/job.json
    Job->>Job: Auto-detect /test_data layout<br/>Set HF offline mode
    Job->>Job: Load datasets from /test_data<br/>(no HuggingFace calls)

    loop For each evaluation batch
        Job->>Model: POST /v1/completions<br/>Auth: OPENAI_API_KEY
        Model-->>Job: Model completions
    end

    Job->>EvalHub: POST results<br/>Auth: Bearer token
